---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Interest Group — Alma-Sophia Merscher"
  description="An international interest group for researchers working on loneliness."
>
  <section class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Interest Group</p>
    <h1>An international group for loneliness researchers</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">
        I started this group in 2023 when I slowly shifted into loneliness research. In my
        view, it can be incredibly helpful to get together with other researchers from time
        to time and talk and discuss whatever research or methodological question or
        proposal idea we have in mind.
      </p>

      <h2>Who it is for</h2>
      <p>
        If you are interested in topics revolving around loneliness or related, you are
        very welcome to join us, no matter at which career stage.
      </p>

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>
        How often the group meets, in what format, and what a typical session looks like.
        Replace this text.
      </p>

      <h2>Joining</h2>
      <p>
        How to get involved. Replace this text — then point people at the
        <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, or give an address here directly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent-rust-deep);
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .prose {
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .prose p {
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2.2rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
</style>
